NativeSupporterVault::upgradeToAndCall (OpenZeppelin UUPS)
├── Given implementation context, unauthorized caller/operator, proxy UUID call or non-UUPS target
│   └── It rejects the unsafe upgrade path
└── Given fixed Safe and compatible UUPS implementation
    └── It preserves open/closed IDs, owner locks, both B/Q ledgers, roles, identities, counters and active recovery budgets
